{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708510/extras/WORLD_OF_ABSYM.png?t=1746806598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Introduction to the World of Absym:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your first glimpse into the dark, enigmatic lore of Absym. Through atmospheric visuals and environmental storytelling, begin piecing together the mystery that lies at the heart of this crumbling universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708510/extras/FIRST_LEVEL.png?t=1746806598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Harbour\u2019s End - The First Level:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the opening chapter of the Absym universe. Navigate treacherous terrain, uncover hidden paths, and engage in fast-paced, tactical combat as you explore the ruins of a forgotten world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708510/extras/HD2D.gif?t=1746806598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708510/extras/UPGRADES.png?t=1746806598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>16 Unique Absym Upgrades:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Power up your Rifter with four distinct Absym enhancements. Experiment with different abilities and find the combo that suits your playstyle, whether you prefer precision, speed, or raw destructive force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708510/extras/Upgrade.gif?t=1746806598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708510/extras/RIFTING_AND_CORRUPTION.png?t=1746806598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rifting &amp; Corruption:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the core mechanic of Rift Dancing, a powerful yet unstable process that lets you manipulate reality by shifting between two dimensions: the decaying world of Nihilor and the corrupted realm of Absymalith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harnessing the energy of the Rift can enhance your abilities, but at a cost: exposure to Absym corruption may warp both body and mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708510/extras/Rift_Combat.gif?t=1746806598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708510/extras/EXPEDITION.png?t=1746806598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Abyssus Expedition:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not alone in this descent. Meet the initial members of the expedition team, a diverse group of specialists assigned to investigate the secrets buried within Nihilor Island. Their knowledge and choices may shape the outcome of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708510/extras/BOSS_BATTLE.png?t=1746806598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Fierce End-Level Boss Battle:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against a challenging boss that will put your reflexes and upgrade choices to the test. Master its attack patterns and exploit its weaknesses, or be destroyed.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708510?t=1746806598","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708510?t=1746806598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708510/b7ad15a2433c941da0e167706d5b1c7b16ac7e4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746806598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708510/b7ad15a2433c941da0e167706d5b1c7b16ac7e4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746806598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708510/extras/WORLD_OF_ABSYM.png?t=1746806598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Introduction to the World of Absym:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your first glimpse into the dark, enigmatic lore of Absym. Through atmospheric visuals and environmental storytelling, begin piecing together the mystery that lies at the heart of this crumbling universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708510/extras/FIRST_LEVEL.png?t=1746806598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Harbour\u2019s End - The First Level:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the opening chapter of the Absym universe. Navigate treacherous terrain, uncover hidden paths, and engage in fast-paced, tactical combat as you explore the ruins of a forgotten world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets